From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: BlackBerry 7 shade counters and no compact tile row

Owner decision 2026-11-19. On the BBOS 7 profile (Settings.Secure sable_profile
is bb7) the Sable shade shows, under the Manage Connections banner, one blue
chip per kind of notification that is waiting (Messages, Email, Calls, Other)
with its count; the notifications themselves are the list below, as before.
The compact tile row is empty on BBOS 7; the brightness slider and media stay.
BBOS 10 is unchanged. SableShadeCoordinator feeds the counts (category only,
ongoing notifications are not counted) to SableShadeCounts.
---
 packages/SystemUI/res/values/sable_bb7_strings.xml | 5 +
 1 file changed

