@@ -784,11 +784,15 @@
                                 )
                                 .padding(horizontal = qsHorizontalMargin())
                     ) {
+                        // Sable: the BBOS 7 profile has no tile row in the compact shade (its
+                        // banner and counters stand in); BBOS 10 keeps it.
